{"Four hundred. That is what my neighbor Linda paid last fall.": "[whispering]",
 "I was twenty three, I was far from home, and a squirrel was eating my tomatoes.": "[laughs]",
 "And at the bottom she wrote, and close the door, Sachiko.": "[whispering]",
 "He only did it once.": "[laughs]",
 "It is a little funny, I must say.": "[laughs]",
 "Or you will learn the same lesson as the squirrel.": "[laughs]",
 "I am sorry, Linda.": "[laughs]",
 "Never climb a ladder alone at our age, please.": "[whispering]",
 "There were babies inside.": "[whispering]",
 "Close the door last. For many years I thought she meant, close the hole at the end of the job.": "[whispering]"}
